## Detailed Workflows

For detailed step-by-step workflows, see `.clinerules/workflows/`:

- **`sync-git.md`** - Commit changes and sync with remote repository
- **`switch-to-main.md`** - Switch to main branch and update with latest changes
- **`switch-to-pr.md`** - Switch to a PR branch, rebase, and sync
- **`check-pr-merged.md`** - Check if PR is merged and cleanup branches
- **`review-pr.md`** - Review pull requests using GitHub CLI
- **`build-and-fix-build-errors.md`** - Build troubleshooting and error fixing

---

## Critical Reminders

- **Follow `.clinerules/git-rules.md`**: Verify feature branch before implementing and committing
- **Small, frequent commits** are preferred over large, infrequent ones
- Use `--force-with-lease` instead of `--force` for safer force pushes
- Run tests before pushing when possible
- Pre-commit hooks help maintain code quality - don't skip them without good reason
